# MASTER GAME DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# GLITCHSTORM: THE LAST SIGNAL

You are an expert AAA game director, senior 3D gameplay engineer, technical artist, narrative designer, UI/UX designer, and game systems architect.

Your task is to design and build a complete, playable, browser-based 3D action game titled:

**GLITCHSTORM: THE LAST SIGNAL**

Tagline: **The world is not ending. It is being rewritten.**

This is not a simple endless survival shooter. It is a cinematic, storyline-driven 3D action game with connected missions, memorable characters, environmental storytelling, meaningful decisions, boss encounters, weapon evolution, and a mysterious science-fiction narrative.

I am developing this game as a solo creator. Prioritize excellent gameplay, visual quality, strong storytelling, and a realistic development scope. Build a polished, playable first chapter rather than creating five unfinished chapters.

Do not simply create a landing page, game mockup, static scene, or basic shooter. Build an actual game that people can play from beginning to end.

