# 9. COMBAT SYSTEM

Combat must feel responsive, satisfying, and readable.

## Hybrid combat

Support both manual aiming and intelligent auto-fire.

Manual aiming:
- Right mouse button enters aim mode.
- Mouse controls aiming direction.
- Left mouse button fires.
- Crosshair indicates the actual firing direction.

Auto-fire:
- F key toggles auto-fire.
- The targeting system selects valid enemies.
- It considers distance, line of sight, weapon range, enemy threat, and target priority.
- It must not shoot through walls.
- It should not target dead or inactive enemies.
- It should not switch targets constantly without reason.

When the player manually aims, manual aiming overrides auto-targeting.

